
@startuml
title 酒店预订系统——顺序图3：顾客取消订单

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #000000
    ParticipantBorderColor #1F2D3D
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantFontColor #0000CC
    ParticipantFontSize 16
    LifeLineBorderColor #1F2D3D
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    MessageFontColor #0000CC
    MessageFontSize 13
}
<style>
participant {
    Padding 28
}
</style>
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

hide footbox

actor "顾客" as Customer
participant ":顾客界面" as UI
participant ":预订订单管理" as Booking
participant ":预订订单" as Order
participant ":每日库存" as Stock
participant ":退款记录" as Refund
participant ":操作日志" as Log

Customer -> UI : 查询本人订单
UI -> Booking : 请求订单详情
Booking -> Order : 查询订单状态及入住日期
Order --> Booking : 返回订单信息
Booking --> UI : 返回订单详情

Customer -> UI : 提交取消申请
UI -> Booking : 提交订单号及取消原因
Booking -> Order : 校验订单状态及入住日期
Order --> Booking : 返回订单校验结果

Booking -> Stock : 释放对应未来住宿日期库存
Stock --> Booking : 返回库存释放结果

Booking -> Refund : 按适用规则处理费用及退款记录
Refund --> Booking : 返回退款记录

Booking -> Order : 将订单状态更新为已取消
Order --> Booking : 返回状态更新结果

Booking -> Log : 记录取消及退款操作
Log --> Booking : 返回记录成功

Booking --> UI : 返回取消结果及退款信息
UI --> Customer : 显示订单取消结果

@enduml

